<%#
  The step panel's Connections section, rendered on its own so a save that
  flips "Come back to this workflow" can re-render it in place
  (StepsController#update).

  A handoff takes no connections: it ends this workflow by handing the run on,
  and the Sub-Flow fields say so right above. Offering Add Connection there
  invited a state the strict import refuses. One that still carries a
  connection keeps the editor, or there would be no way to remove it.

  Local variables:
  - step: AR Step object
  - workflow: Workflow object
%>
<% if !step.hands_off? || step.transitions.any? %>
  <%= render "steps/transitions_editor", step: step, workflow: workflow %>
<% end %>
